ur viewers vote to decide your fate by deciding which of the 5 bosses you will face in battle next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade Voting - Let viewers spend your hard earned power cores, and choose which upgrade you can unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Player Override - And if you don't like their choices? You can have the option to overrule them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1346320/extras/29c0152637f539d24fc61d1f853540c8.webp?t=1758744937\" width=610 height=55 /></span></p>","developers":["Andrew Nutter666 Jaggar","George Dutton"],"dlc":[1749690],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1346320/header.jpg?t=1758744937","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sierra 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1346320/399227/9c9ec206994df9a82bb94305ed41806c0b5eba46/1751224886/dash_av1.mpd?t=1631030433","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1346320/399227/9c9ec206994df9a82bb94305ed41806c0b5eba46/1751224886/dash_h264.mpd?t=1631030433","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1346320/399227/9c9ec206994df9a82bb94305ed41806c0b5eba46/1751224886/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1631030433","id":256850458,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets