 style shoot 'em up. Blast through hordes of bugs, collect powerups and battle giant bosses as you harvest their power cores to upgrade your ship.","steam_appid":1346320,"support_info":{"email":"nutter666@live.co.uk","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}